{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_1","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"生氣通天論篇第三","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_2","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"黃帝曰：夫自古通天者，生之本，本於陰陽。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_3","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"天地之間，六合之內，其氣九州、九竅、五臟十二節，皆通乎天氣。","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_4","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"其生五，其氣三，數犯此者，則邪氣傷人，此壽命之本也。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_5","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"蒼天之氣，清靜則志意治，順之則陽氣固，雖有賊邪，弗能害也，此因時之序。","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_6","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"故聖人傳精神，服天氣而通神明。失之則內閉九竅，外壅肌肉，衛氣解散，此謂自傷，氣之削也。","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_7","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"陽氣者，若天與日，失其所，則折壽而不彰。故天運當以日光明。是故陽因而上，衛外者也。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_8","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"因於寒，欲如運樞，起居如驚，神氣乃浮。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_9","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"因於暑汗，煩則喘喝，靜則多言。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_10","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"體若燔炭，汗出而散。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_11","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"因於濕，首如裹。濕熱不攘，大筋轜短，小筋馳長。轜短為拘，馳長為痿。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_12","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"因於氣，為腫。四維相代，陽氣乃竭。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_13","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"陽氣者，煩勞則張，精絕，辟積於夏，使人煎厥；目盲不可以視，耳閉不可以聽，潰潰乎若壞都，汨汨乎不可止。","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_14","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"陽氣者，大怒則形氣絕而血菀於上，使人薄厥。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_15","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"有傷於筋，縱，其若不容。","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_16","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"汗出偏沮，使人偏枯。","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_17","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"汗出見濕，乃生痤疿。","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_18","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"高梁之變，足生大丁受如持虛。","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_19","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"勞汗當風，寒薄為皶，鬱乃痤。","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_20","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"陽氣者，精則養神，柔則養筋。","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_21","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"開闔不得，寒氣從之，乃生大僂。","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_22","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"陷脈為瘻，留連肉腠。","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_23","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"俞氣化薄，傳為善畏，及為驚駭。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_24","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"營氣不從，逆於肉理，乃生癰腫。","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_25","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"魄汗未盡，形弱而氣爍，穴俞以閉，發為風瘧。","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_26","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"故風者，百病之始也，清靜則肉腠閉拒，雖有大風苛毒，弗之能害，此因時之序也。","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_27","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"故病久則傳化，上下不併，良醫弗為。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_28","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"故陽畜積病死，而陽氣當隔。隔者當瀉，不亟正治，粗乃敗之。","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_29","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"故陽氣者，一日而主外。平旦人氣生，日中而陽氣隆，日西而陽氣已虛，氣門乃閉。是故暮而收拒，無擾筋骨，無見霧露，反此三時，形乃困薄。","sortOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_30","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"岐伯曰：陰者藏精而起極也，陽者衛外而為固也。陰不勝其陽，則脈流薄疾，併乃狂。陽不勝其陰，則五臟氣爭，九竅不通。","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_31","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"是以聖人陳陰陽，筋脈和同，骨髓堅固，氣血皆從。如是則內外調和，邪不能害，耳目聰明，氣立如故。","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_32","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"風客淫氣，精乃亡，邪傷肝也。","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_33","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"因而飽食，筋脈橫解，腸澼為痔。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_34","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"因而大飲，則氣逆。","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_35","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"因而強力，腎氣乃傷，高骨乃壞。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_36","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"凡陰陽之要，陽密乃固，兩者不和，若春無秋，若冬無夏。因而和之，是謂聖度。","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_37","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"故陽強不能密，陰氣乃絕。","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_38","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"陰平陽秘，精神乃治；陰陽離決，精氣乃絕。","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_39","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"因於露風，乃生寒熱。","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_40","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"是以春傷於風，邪氣留連，乃為洞泄。","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_41","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"夏傷於暑，秋為痎瘧。","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_42","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"秋傷於濕，上逆而咳，發為痿厥。","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_43","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"冬傷於寒，春必溫病。","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_44","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"四時之氣，更傷五臟。","sortOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_45","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"陰之所生，本在五味；陰之五宮，傷在五味。","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_46","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"是故味過於酸，肝氣以津，脾氣乃絕。","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_47","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"味過於鹹，大骨氣勞，短肌，心氣抑。","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_48","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"味過於甘，心氣喘滿，色黑，腎氣不衡。","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_49","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"味過於苦，脾氣不濡，胃氣乃厚。","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_50","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"味過於辛，筋脈沮弛，精神乃央。","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_hdnk_3_51","chapterId":"ch_work_hdnk_3","text":"是故謹和五味，骨正筋柔，氣血以流，腠理以密，如是則骨氣以精。謹道如法，長有天命。","sortOrder":51}],"overrides":{}}